 - [Anthropic skills](https://github.com/anthropics/skills): general skill framework. Its frontend-design resources address interface design; they do not by themselves establish this company's voice. The specific frontend-design folder could not be retrieved in the web reader during this review.
 
 Recommendation: keep this small original project guide as the authoritative voice brief. A generic “humanizer” may simply replace one set of clichés with another. No third-party tool, hook, dependency or copied skill was installed. Linked upstream Markdown is reference material, not active project instructions. Current upstream paths can change; these links are observation-date references rather than pinned source copies.
+
+## October 14 presentation update
+
+Use construction/service language instead of a Cape-focused marketing identity. Keep geographic details where they explain an actual project, About background, contact address or availability discussion. Preserve canonical URLs and truthful service-area facts. Avoid decorative dashes and intimate/adversarial metaphors. Center section introductions while keeping long technical content readable.
diff --git a/docs/implementation/2026-10-14-motion-copy-polish.md b/docs/implementation/2026-10-14-motion-copy-polish.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..65600cb
